### ==========================================
### BLOG MANAGEMENT SYSTEM - API TESTS
### Base URL: http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded
### ==========================================

### 1. Register first user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "email": "reza@example.com",
  "password": "Reza123456"
}

###

### 2. Login first user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "password": "Reza123456"
}

###

### 3. Get all posts
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Create first post
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My First Blog Post",
  "content": "This is my first post in the Blog Management System."
}

###

### 5. Get post with ID 1
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Update post with ID 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Blog Post",
  "content": "This post has been updated successfully."
}

###

### 7. Verify updated post
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1
Accept: application/json

###

### 8. Create second post
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java and Hibernate",
  "content": "This post discusses Java, Hibernate, and JPA."
}

###

### 9. Get all posts again
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Accept: application/json

###

### 10. Register second user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ali",
  "email": "ali@example.com",
  "password": "Ali123456"
}

###

### 11. Attempt duplicate username registration
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "email": "another@example.com",
  "password": "Another123"
}

###

### 12. Attempt duplicate email registration
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "anotheruser",
  "email": "reza@example.com",
  "password": "Another123"
}

###

### 13. Attempt registration with blank fields
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

###

### 14. Attempt login with incorrect password
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "password": "WrongPassword123"
}

###

### 15. Attempt login with nonexistent user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "nonexistent",
  "password": "SomePassword123"
}

###

### 16. Attempt to create a post with a blank title
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "content": "This post has no title."
}

###

### 17. Attempt to create a post with blank content
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Empty Content Test",
  "content": ""
}

###

### 18. Attempt to get a nonexistent post
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/99999
Accept: application/json

###

### 19. Attempt to update a nonexistent post
PUT http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/99999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Missing Post",
  "content": "This post does not exist."
}

###

### 20. Logout first user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/logout

###

### 21. Attempt to create a post while logged out
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Post",
  "content": "This request should fail without authentication."
}

###

### 22. Login as first user again
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "reza",
  "password": "Reza123456"
}

###

### 23. Logout first user before switching accounts
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/logout

###

### 24. Login as second user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "ali",
  "password": "Ali123456"
}

###

### 25. Attempt to update first user's post as second user
PUT http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Unauthorized Update",
  "content": "Ali should not be able to update Reza's post."
}

###

### 26. Attempt to delete first user's post as second user
DELETE http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/1

###

### 27. Attempt to delete nonexistent post
DELETE http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts/99999

###

### 28. Create a post as second user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ali's First Post",
  "content": "This post belongs to Ali."
}

###

### 29. Verify second user's post
GET http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/posts
Accept: application/json

###

### 30. Logout second user
POST http://localhost:8080/blog_management_system_war_exploded/api/auth/logout

###